# BUILD Skills Sync

Read and follow `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md` and `SKILLS-PUBLICATION.md`; all publication requires review and frozen canonical sources.

Source of truth is `$ORSAYN_AI_ROOT/skills/`; ignored `docs/` is a publishing mirror, never an authoring source. Published catalogue v2 mappings:

- `oracle-by-orsayn/SKILL.md` + `oracle-by-orsayn/references/` -> `docs/oracle-by-orsayn/SKILL.md` + `docs/oracle-by-orsayn/references/` (ZIP);
- `oracle-site-web.md` -> `docs/oracle-site-web.md`;
- `ux-ui-design-2/` -> `docs/ux-ui-design/`;
- `backend-orsayn/` -> `docs/backend-orsayn/`;
- `deep-research-vertical/` -> `docs/deep-research-vertical/`;
- `apple-design-skills/` -> `docs/apple-design-skills/`;
- `code-motion-production/` -> `docs/code-motion-production/` (BEGINNER explicitly authorized).

Never publish retired `expert-backend-v2.md`; authority is `backend-orsayn/references/17-domains.md`. Discover native Hermes paths and preserve their categories.

Validate entire source bundles, back up mirrors, exclude `.DS_Store`, compare canonical/Hermes/BUILD hashes and rerun stability checks before/after remote publication. App changes require `npm test`, `npm run lint`, `npm run build`.

After explicit review only, `npm run skills:sync` uploads immutable releases and verifies bytes, then publishes and strictly reads back `catalogs/v2/manifest.json`: schema version 2, catalogVersion 2, exact seven artifacts. NEVER overwrite legacy `manifest.json` or delete its referenced releases. Publish/independently verify v2 before new app deployment; rollback old app continues using legacy. See phased runbook.

Never commit `docs/`, `.env.local`, `.next/`, `tsconfig.tsbuildinfo`; never reveal credentials. No upload/deploy/watcher accept during preparation. Do not announce availability before independent ZIP member readback and deployed UI/API/MCP checks. Fixtures are not live evidence. Coordinate watcher acceptance across all workers.
